  "source_first_method": "Read exact Peter Woit versioned original §3.1 first, freeze local relation/argument/result/dependency and negative scopes, then cross-check exact already frozen G0 typed source identities and reciprocal SSC owner. Do not import W31, textbook theorems, L, bridge, primitive basis, source truth, or physics qualification.",
